      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start. can u expand on the section about modern data biases? like, how can i teach the kids that these banking algorithms aren't just \"neutral math\" but actually carry those racial biases forward? i want to make sure they understand that the math itself can be a tool for systemic inequality.",
