      "content": "that's a powerful way to frame it. i want to make sure the kids can argue against people who claim these outcomes are just about individual merit or different economic choices. can you help me draft a section that addresses those counterarguments? how should i teach them to respond to people who say the wealth gap is just a matter of personal financial responsibility rather than these systemic issues?",
